  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Son k\u0131s\u0131mlarda, \"ters d\xF6nm\xFC\u015F\" bir gemi enkaz\u0131 var
    {{isim}}. Gemiden artakalanlara tutunan insanlar g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Bu manzara,
    san\u0131r\u0131m ge\xE7mi\u015Fte yak\u0131n \xE7evrenden bir insanla aran\u0131zda
    ge\xE7en tart\u0131\u015Fmalardan bu yana zihnine \"kaotik d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin\"
    h\xFCkmetti\u011Finin i\u015Fareti. \u015Eimdilerde her iki taraf\u0131n da birbirine
    \xF6n yarg\u0131yla yakla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor telvelerin.
    Zira fal\u0131nda resmedilen gemi enkaz\u0131ndan kurtulmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan
    zihnin ve d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin, t\u0131rmanmas\u0131 kolay \"\xF6n yarg\u0131lar\u0131\"
    temsil eden par\xE7alara tutunmu\u015F. Ona kar\u015F\u0131 olan bu \xF6n yarg\u0131lar\u0131n
    {{ay_2}} ay\u0131n\u0131n {{kelime, son g\xFCnlerinde | ortalar\u0131nda | \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC
    haftas\u0131n\u0131n son g\xFCnlerinde}} sana yapaca\u011F\u0131 bir \"iyilikle\"
    adeta tuzla buz olacak. Ne \xE7ok \"\xF6n yarg\u0131\" dedim \xF6yle de\u011Fil
    mi? Bu arada evet; \"\xF6n yarg\u0131\" ayr\u0131 yaz\u0131l\u0131r."
